# Copies gitignored local-secrets files into every worktree Claude Code
# creates itself (`claude --worktree`, `isolation: "worktree"`,
# `EnterWorktree` without a `path`) -- gitignore syntax, per
# code.claude.com/docs/en/worktrees. Only ever copies a file that is ALSO
# gitignored, so nothing tracked is ever duplicated. This does NOT fire for
# a worktree the `working-in-worktrees` skill's `start` mode creates with a
# plain `git worktree add` -- that mode copies these same files by hand; see
# its own step for why.
.env
.env.local
